# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4-seats8-262k window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it):
# copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/seats8-262k and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN.
# Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. A placeholder in @...@ is filled in by
# whoever drives the window (@SERVED_IMAGE@: the served image's reference; @K64J_GRAFT_DIR@ and @K64J_TTNNCPP_SHA256@: the K64j graft
# directory and its binary's digest, the one-card harnesses); every other value is final. ORDER.txt says the order, each job's
# image, its stop rule and its minutes.
# DEFERRED (the owner skipped the single-card evidence run: the quad-first window runs on the gate-only evidence waiver instead; this job stays in the pack, after the quad jobs).
# STAGE 1 of the 262k window (the I2 evidence): card M alone through the cardm action (C2_CARDS=pair: cardm is a pair-shaped step), the
# harness being this checkout's own code run in the I1 base image, so no new image is needed. Production is DOWN from A0 to the hand-back.
# An EVIDENCE job: one harness on card M alone (the quad jobs reset all four boards, this one never does). The harness runs its own
# image and mounts this checkout's scripts as the code under test. The K64j graft binary is pinned by EXPECT_TTNNCPP_SHA256: read the
# launched argv, a graft mounted is not a graft executed. A watcher job (W) runs before its full job; a REDUCED-PASS or a reduced scope
# is never evidence. A FAIL or a NO-DECISION here blocks the 262k window pending kernel work; I1 (eight 131k seats) is unaffected.
# E2c (CB2b at 262,144): R1 (the pinned mask kernel at capacity 256), S (staging), R2 (more than 50 families at C = 262,144, the named
# ones being 256, 2304, 16640, 65792, 131328 and 262144) and R4 (idle segments), seeds 0-2, normal and peaky, through the one-chip-of-four
# view. PASS: 'K64J_READER verdict=PASS scope=full ... capacity=262144 chips=1of4 ... extent_sha256=<the sha of
# extent_attention_replay_tp.py, unchanged>' (the reader's bytes are frozen: the 131k record's sha is the 262k record's).
# Duration (estimate): 20-30 min. Stop rule: a FAIL or a reduced scope blocks 262k.
C2_CARDS=pair
C2_ACTIONS=cardm
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-serve-8
C2_CARDM_HARNESS=optimisation/ttnn-op/k64j/run_card_b.sh
C2_CARDM_ARGS=--sections R1,S,R2,R4 --seeds 0,1,2 --variants normal,peaky --capacity 262144 --r2-named 256,2304,16640,65792,131328,262144
C2_CARDM_ENV=K64J_HARNESS=extent_reader TP4_WIDTH=4 IMAGE=@SERVED_IMAGE@ KOPGRAFT64=@K64J_GRAFT_DIR@ EXPECT_TTNNCPP_SHA256=@K64J_TTNNCPP_SHA256@
